claim.claim-text:
(a) providing an anode, a cathode, a porous separator, and an electrolyte;
wherein the cathode comprises one or more transition metal oxides, and wherein the porous separator comprises an inorganic oxide and an anionic compound which comprises an anthraquinone; and wherein a lithium metal layer is provided on a surface of the separator; and then
(b) assembling so as to provide a battery that comprises the anode, the cathode, the electrolyte, and the separator, wherein the separator is interposed between the cathode and anode.
